    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Running an antique shop can be hard, but it's even harder when you're a tiny elephant! Though that won't stop Stompy from living out their dream! Help the best (and cutest) antique dealer in town and discover what it's truly like being an elephant in a china shop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/e8b6770d59778dd2689227c0029f57f0.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/e8b6770d59778dd2689227c0029f57f0.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/e8b6770d59778dd2689227c0029f57f0.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break-trunk speeds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This shop is working out better than expected... You've got loads of customers waiting for you and they all want something different! Be prepared to rush across your shop, on the lookout for the specific items that are needed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/3b54be29bd51616f673eae52a72cca7f.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/3b54be29bd51616f673eae52a72cca7f.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/3b54be29bd51616f673eae52a72cca7f.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch your steps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While not having fingers might be somewhat of an handicap when running an antique shop, Stompy more than makes up for it by using their mighty trunk to carry everything around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/8ee60d773dd08b9a8b81b5d5a98b6dd6.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/8ee60d773dd08b9a8b81b5d5a98b6dd6.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/8ee60d773dd08b9a8b81b5d5a98b6dd6.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Look out for the porcelain vases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to break the precious porcelain vases that can be found in the shop, they look expensive and you really can't afford to break them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/f5463242f8f163825fad66a76a342059.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/f5463242f8f163825fad66a76a342059.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/f5463242f8f163825fad66a76a342059.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Running an antique shop can be hard, but it's even harder when you're a tiny elephant! Though that won't stop Stompy from living out their dream! Help the best (and cutest) antique dealer in town and discover what it's truly like being an elephant in a china shop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/e8b6770d59778dd2689227c0029f57f0.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/e8b6770d59778dd2689227c0029f57f0.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/e8b6770d59778dd2689227c0029f57f0.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break-trunk speeds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This shop is working out better than expected... You've got loads of customers waiting for you and they all want something different! Be prepared to rush across your shop, on the lookout for the specific items that are needed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/3b54be29bd51616f673eae52a72cca7f.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/3b54be29bd51616f673eae52a72cca7f.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/3b54be29bd51616f673eae52a72cca7f.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch your steps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While not having fingers might be somewhat of an handicap when running an antique shop, Stompy more than makes up for it by using their mighty trunk to carry everything around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/8ee60d773dd08b9a8b81b5d5a98b6dd6.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/8ee60d773dd08b9a8b81b5d5a98b6dd6.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/8ee60d773dd08b9a8b81b5d5a98b6dd6.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Look out for the porcelain vases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to break the precious porcelain vases that can be found in the shop, they look expensive and you really can't afford to break them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/f5463242f8f163825fad66a76a342059.poster.avif?t=1750515308\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/f5463242f8f163825fad66a76a342059.webm?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618820/extras/f5463242f8f163825fad66a76a342059.mp4?t=1750515308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
